{"2939680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Infectious Madness of Doctor Dekker 2", "steam_appid": 2939680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A missing body. A murdered professor. Five mysterious patients and a former femme fatale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play therapist and detective in a twisted Lovecraftian journey through the minds of six questionable suspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save your patients or catch the killer? Or can you do both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you decide, your assistant Marianna will always be there for you - unless she’s the killer of course…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMPLE UI - ask questions and respond to patients, watch replays and gather evidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE - link answers together to progress </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MISSION TRACKER - your notepad keeps you updated </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MULTIPLE ENDINGS - multiple patient outcomes, player fates and killer endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO SPOILERS - murderers are chosen at random when the game begins </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 5th game from the creators of The Infectious Madness of Doctor Dekker, The Shapeshifting Detective, Dark Nights with Poe and Munro, and Murderous Muses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939680/extras/3b13f1b4603043f84dd3fcd13922585d.avif?t=1783441107\" width=225 height=173 /></span></p><p clas